    78|<p>"Readings are nominal," Aisha Hassan reported, voice steady over the comms. Their boots crunched nearby as they monitored the portable analyzer. "Atmospheric processors holding at 10.2 psi. CO2 scrubbers at 96% efficiency. Radiation levels... actually lower than predicted. Something's different about today's solar flux."</p>
